    "sensesNotes": "Darkvision 60 ft, Keen Smell",
    "tactics": "Reef Sharks circle below swimmers and attack wounded targets first. They withdraw briefly when injured, then return when blood or movement draws them back. A lone shark avoids a full crew, but a pack can keep a vessel's survivors from reaching shore.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Bite [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 2), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Blood Scent: The Reef Shark has Fortune on Perception checks to locate a creature that has taken damage in the water. Feeding Frenzy: When an ally is adjacent to a wounded creature, the Reef Shark subtracts 1 from both attack dice against that creature. Aquatic Body: The Reef Shark can breathe water indefinitely. On land, it moves at half speed and adds 1 to both attack dice.</p>",
